{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516022-hedge-chase-fillable-spreadsheet","id":1516022,"title":"Hedge Chase Fillable Spreadsheet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-24T10:30:42-07:00","id":1516022,"title":"Hedge Chase Fillable Spreadsheet","content":"After reading and analyzing extensively the modifiers for Hedge Chase, I decided to make a spreadsheet to calculate automatically the number of success needed to navigate trought it.<br /> <br /> Since it cost nothing to share, I decided to post here for you guys.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i5K1pLjwszvGYLOc7Ub1vi-5b41Os2wKQToYRoWHYC0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i5K1pLjwszvGYLOc7Ub1vi-5b41Os2wKQToYRoWHYC0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i5K1pLjwszvGYLOc7Ub1vi-5b41Os2wKQToYRoWHYC0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i5K1pLjwszvGYLOc7Ub1vi-5b41Os2wKQToYRoWHYC0/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This link allows for visualization, just need to copy it.<br /> If for some unknow reason the script to calculate some portions of it does not work, just add the script on your google account<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> function compararValores(celula1, celula2) {<br /> var valor1 = celula1;<br /> var valor2 = celula2;<br /> <br /> if (valor1 &gt; valor2) {<br /> if (valor1 &gt;= valor2 * 10) {<br /> return 5;<br /> } else if (valor1 &gt;= valor2 * 2) {<br /> return 3;<br /> } else {<br /> return 1;<br /> }<br /> } else {<br /> return 0;<br /> }<br /> }<br /> function compararValores2(celula1, celula2) {<br /> var valor1 = celula1;<br /> var valor2 = celula2;<br /> <br /> if (valor1 &gt; valor2) {<br /> if (valor1 &gt;= valor2 * 3) {<br /> return 3;<br /> } else if (valor1 &gt;= valor2 * 2) {<br /> return 2;<br /> } else {<br /> return 1;<br /> }<br /> } else {<br /> return 0<br /> }<br /> }\u200b<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a>